{"ayah/20-50.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:50 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Ubangijin mu Shi ne wanda Ya bai wa dukan kõme halittarsa, sa&#x27;an nan Ya shiryar.&quot;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:50 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Ubangijin mu Shi ne wanda Ya bai wa dukan kõme halittarsa, sa&#x27;an nan Ya shiryar.&quot;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 50\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-50.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/20.html\">Sura Taa-Haa</a> › Aya 50</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Taa-Haa 20:50</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ رَبُّنَا الَّذِي أَعْطَىٰ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ خَلْقَهُ ثُمَّ هَدَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ya ce: &quot;Ubangijin mu Shi ne wanda Ya bai wa dukan kõme halittarsa, sa&#x27;an nan Ya shiryar.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالخلق يتناول كل ما سواه من المخلوقات<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/111</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي أعطى كل شيء صورته التي لا يشتبه فيها بغيره<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 2/35</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والمعنى أعطاه من الخلق والتصوير ما يصلح به لما خلق له ثم هداه لما خلق له وهداه لما يصلحه في معيشته ومطعمه ومشربه ومنكحه وتقلبه وتصرفه هذا هو القول الصحيح الذي عليه جمهور المفسرين<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكذلك كل عضو له هداية تليق به فهدى الرجلين للمشي واليدين للبطش والعمل واللسان للكلام والأذن للاستماع والعين لكشف المرئيات وكل عضو لما خلق له<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 2/35</cite></blockquote><h3>Abin da ya ruwaito daga wasu</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مجاهد</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «أعطى كل شيء خلقه لم يعط الإنسان خلق البهائم ولا البهائم خلق الإنسان»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عطية ومقاتل</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قال عطية ومقاتل: &quot;أعطى كل شيء صورته&quot;»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن وقتادة</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «وقال الحسن وقتادة: &quot;أعطى كل شيء صلاحه&quot;»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الكلبي والسدي وابن قتيبة والفراء</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «وقال الكلبي والسدي: &quot;أعطى الرجل المرأة والبعير الناقة والذكر الأنثى من جنسه&quot; ولفظ السدي: &quot;أعطى الذكر الأنثى مثل خلقه ثم هدى إلى الجماع&quot; وهذا القول اختيار ابن قتيبة والفراء»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الفراء</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «قال الفراء: &quot;أعطى الذكر من الناس امرأة مثله والشاة شاة والثور بقرة ثم ألهم الذكر كيف يأتيها&quot;»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أبو إسحاق</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «قال أبو إسحاق: &quot;وهذا التفسير جائز لأنا نرى الذكر من الحيوان يأتي الأنثى ولم ير ذكرا قد أتى أنثى قبله فألهمه الله ذلك وهداه إليه&quot; قال: والقول الأول ينتظم هذا المعنى لأنه إذا هداه لمصلحته فهذا داخل في المصلحة»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s20a50\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-48.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (20:48)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-52.html\">Aya ta gaba (20:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:52 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Saninsu yanã a wurin Ubangijĩna, Ubangijĩna bã Ya ɓacẽwa kuma bã Ya mantuwa.&quot;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:52 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Saninsu yanã a wurin Ubangijĩna, Ubangijĩna bã Ya ɓacẽwa kuma bã Ya mantuwa.&quot;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 52\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-52.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/20.html\">Sura Taa-Haa</a> › Aya 52</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Taa-Haa 20:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ عِلْمُهَا عِندَ رَبِّي فِي كِتَابٍ لَّا يَضِلُّ رَبِّي وَلَا يَنسَى﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ya ce: &quot;Saninsu yanã a wurin Ubangijĩna, Ubangijĩna bã Ya ɓacẽwa kuma bã Ya mantuwa.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">النسيان والخطأ، كما قال تعالى: {لا يضل ربي ولا ينسى} [طه: 52]<cite>«درء تعارض العقل والنقل» 10/246</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s20a52\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-50.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (20:50)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-55.html\">Aya ta gaba (20:55)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-55.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:55 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Daga gare ta Muka halitta ku, kuma a cikinta Muke mayar da ku, kuma daga gare ta Muke fitar da ku a wani lõkaci na dabam.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:55 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Daga gare ta Muka halitta ku, kuma a cikinta Muke mayar da ku, kuma daga gare ta Muke fitar da ku a wani lõkaci na dabam.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 55\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-55.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/20.html\">Sura Taa-Haa</a> › Aya 55</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Taa-Haa 20:55</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿مِنْهَا خَلَقْنَاكُمْ وَفِيهَا نُعِيدُكُمْ وَمِنْهَا نُخْرِجُكُمْ تَارَةً أُخْرَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Daga gare ta Muka halitta ku, kuma a cikinta Muke mayar da ku, kuma daga gare ta Muke fitar da ku a wani lõkaci na dabam.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">من التراب وإلى التراب يعودون. كما قال تعالى: {منها خلقناكم وفيها نعيدكم ومنها نخرجكم تارة أخرى}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/250</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s20a55\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-52.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (20:52)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-71.html\">Aya ta gaba (20:71)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-71.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:71 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Kun yi ĩmãni sabõda shi a gabãnin in yi muku izni? Lalle shĩ, haƙĩƙa, babbanku ne wanda ya sanar da ku sihirin! To, lalle ne zan kakkãtse hannayenk\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-71.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:71 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Kun yi ĩmãni sabõda shi a gabãnin in yi muku izni? Lalle shĩ, haƙĩƙa, babbanku ne wanda ya sanar da ku sihirin! To, lalle ne zan kakkãtse hannayenk\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 71\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-71.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/20.html\">Sura Taa-Haa</a> › Aya 71</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Taa-Haa 20:71</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ آمَنتُمْ لَهُ قَبْلَ أَنْ آذَنَ لَكُمْ إِنَّهُ لَكَبِيرُكُمُ الَّذِي عَلَّمَكُمُ السِّحْرَ فَلَأُقَطِّعَنَّ أَيْدِيَكُمْ وَأَرْجُلَكُم مِّنْ خِلَافٍ وَلَأُصَلِّبَنَّكُمْ فِي جُذُوعِ النَّخْلِ وَلَتَعْلَمُنَّ أَيُّنَا أَشَدُّ عَذَابًا وَأَبْقَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ya ce: &quot;Kun yi ĩmãni sabõda shi a gabãnin in yi muku izni? Lalle shĩ, haƙĩƙa, babbanku ne wanda ya sanar da ku sihirin! To, lalle ne zan kakkãtse hannayenku da ƙafãfunku a tarnaƙi kuma lalle zan tsĩre ku a cikin kututturan itãcen dabĩno, kuma lalle zã ku sani wanenmu ne mafi tsananin azãba kuma wãne ne mafi wanzuwar (azãba).&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وليس المراد أنهم في جوف النخل وجوف الأرض؛<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/272</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s20a71\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-55.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (20:55)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-74.html\">Aya ta gaba (20:74)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-74.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:74 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lalle shĩ wanda ya je wa Ubangijinsa yanã mai laifi, to lalle ne yanã da Jahannama, bã ya mutuwa a cikinta kuma bã ya rãyuwa.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-74.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:74 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lalle shĩ wanda ya je wa Ubangijinsa yanã mai laifi, to lalle ne yanã da Jahannama, bã ya mutuwa a cikinta kuma bã ya rãyuwa.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 74\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-74.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/20.html\">Sura Taa-Haa</a> › Aya 74</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Taa-Haa 20:74</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّهُ مَن يَأْتِ رَبَّهُ مُجْرِمًا فَإِنَّ لَهُ جَهَنَّمَ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحْيَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Lalle shĩ wanda ya je wa Ubangijinsa yanã mai laifi, to lalle ne yanã da Jahannama, bã ya mutuwa a cikinta kuma bã ya rãyuwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ونظيره قوله تعالى {إنه من يأت ربه مجرما فإن له جهنم لا يموت فيها ولا يحيا} ونظيره: {أنه من عمل منكم سوءا بجهالة ثم تاب من بعده وأصلح فأنه غفور رحيم} فهما تأكيدان مقصودان لمعنيين مختلفين<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/277</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s20a74\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-71.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (20:71)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/20-77.html\">Aya ta gaba (20:77)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-77.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Taa-Haa 20:77 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma lalle ne haƙĩƙa Mun yi wahayi zuwa ga Mũsã cẽwa, &quot;Ka yi tafiyar dare da bãyiNa. Sa&#x27;an nan ka dõka musu hanya a cikin tẽku tana ƙẽƙasasshiya, bã ka tsõ\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-77.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhai